eat of the music. The colors are taken from your palette, and randomly selected to correspond to the varying pitches in the song.","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"rhythm","tags":["vibrant"," happy"," classical"," pop"," acoustic"],"features":[],"pluginConfig":[{"name":"transTime","type":"int","defaultValue":24,"minValue":1,"maxValue":600}]},{"uuid":"337784c0-6c98-447a-8a9f-fc6ac44a8024","name":"Streaking Notes","description":"Each color of your palette is assigned from low notes to high notes. When that note plays, you'll see that color shoot across your Aurora","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"rhythm","tags":["pop"," party"," electronic"],"features":[]},{"uuid":"5cec763a-6f32-45cf-a691-b81e176b6b4a","name":"Fireworks","description":"This could be your very own mini EDM festival. In this musical fireworks display, explosions of color from your palette are set off to the bass of the song. ","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"rhythm","tags":["happy"," electronic"," party"," vibrant"," pop"],"features":[]},{"uuid":"60333927-cc36-4a5a-a682-9bd114de8bff","name":"Pulse Pop Beats","description":"Designed for vocals and slow jams. Increased flux in the song will trigger pops of color on the panels, and a pulse of colors with fluctuation in the tone of the song. ","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"rhythm","tags":["electronic"," rap"," classical"],"features":[]},{"uuid":"6970681a-20b5-4c5e-8813-bdaebc4ee4fa","name":"Wheel","description":"Provides a continuous moving gradient of color created from your palette.","author":"Nanoleaf","type":"color","tags":["party"," chill"," zen"],"features":["touch"],"pluginConfig":[{"name":"loop","type":"bool","defaultValue":true},{"name":"transTime","type":"int","defaultValue":24,"minValue":1,"maxValue":600},{"name":"nColorsPerFrame","type":"int","defaultValue":2,"minValue":2,"maxValue":50},{"name":"linDirection","type":"string","defaultValue":"right","strings":["left","right","up","down"]}]},{"uuid":"70b7c636-6bf8-491f-89c1-f4103508d642","name":"Highlight","descr